Package: com.huayuarc.sbjetsamguard
Name: SBJetsamGuard
Version: 1.3.0
Architecture: iphoneos-arm64
Description: SpringBoard Jetsam memory-limit relief with Settings panel, bounded manual disk-cache cleanup and opt-in verified sysctl tuning. Preserves existing higher limits and global memory-pressure reclamation. No UI injection, swap files or signal suppression; not a fix for SIGILL crashes.
